From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:23:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: show the Shizuku placeholder package only to apps
 authorized in Plait Broker

Apps such as Aurora Store offer their Shizuku features only when moe.shizuku.privileged.api is installed. PlaitOS ships a
code-less placeholder with that name; PlaitShizukuVisibility hides it from every app except the app ids Plait Broker writes
to the global setting plait_shizuku_visible (system uids always see it). A missing or unreadable setting hides it from all.
---
